**/desktop.ini
**/*.swp
**/*.swo
**/tmp
**/temp
**/dist
**/build
**/.nuget
**/.dotnet
**/TestResults
**/*.trx
**/documentation
**/docs
**/*.md
!**/README.md
**/openspec